        check(em['band'] == [120, 200] and em['tc'] > 2.5 and len(em['sig']) >= 2 and all(x[0].replace("'", '’') == e0n and x[1] == 0 for x in em['sig']) and em['byLat'] == 11 and em['heat'] >= 10 and em['plot'] and 'HF' in em['lbl'], f'v4.18 : onglet EM — 120–200 Hz, voies significatives (Bonferroni) sur l’électrode de début avec un délai nul, courbe des latences, fond z ({em})')
